ceived_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T07:09:52Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T07:09:52Z","body":"## Update summary\n\nAddressed feedback: merged from `main` and fixed the simultaneous-hint overlap.\n\n**Root cause:** When the grenade tutorial appeared at the same time as another hint (e.g. scope on AK GL), the old `index * HINT_SPACING` formula used a fixed 60 px gap that ignored multi-line grenade hint content, causing it to overlap the hint below.\n\n**Fix:** `_update_all_hint_positions` and `_update_hint_position` now accumulate the **actual content height** of each preceding hint (via `get_content_height()`) instead of multiplying the slot index by a fixed constant. Each hint is placed strictly above the one below, regardless of how many lines it spans.\n\nA new regression test `test_tutorial_grenade_hint_stacks_above_existing_hints_without_overlap` verifies cumulative stacking is used and `index * HINT_SPACING` is gone.\n\ndotnet build: 0 errors.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4278550384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4278552162","html_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pull/1882#issuecomment-4278552162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/1882","id":4278552162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQ35BQ87_BYZi","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}",